{"v":1,"stages":["Welcome","Stage 1: Foundational knowledge","Stage 2: Building safety","Stage 3: Unstucking defense"],"rows":[{"id":2422087,"s":0,"t":"Welcome to the Unstucking Pathway!","k":"video","v":"m2dvkpb2bzk2r04n2l0gvd9fy9aq","d":164,"c":0},{"id":2422088,"s":0,"t":"The Three Stages Structure","k":"video","v":"xhsi4c56i3ubicjuoz2q8masiqrv","d":104,"c":0},{"id":2422123,"s":0,"t":"Small Steps & Small Habits","k":"video","v":"zavj52kg8uat5zf03mpg3dpekeh9","d":168},{"id":2422093,"s":1,"t":"Welcome to Stage 1","k":"video","v":"2p98sj2buzrguk2e8fi0sir7c21v","d":184},{"id":2422094,"s":1,"t":"Autonomic Nervous System","k":"video","v":"9a7ty9u6ac6f2gcip5154ai1t2xj","d":270,"c":0},{"id":2422105,"s":1,"t":"Polyvagal Ladder","k":"video","v":"l9mevpmqgmgqfxn4sbaf08vw7suo","d":211,"c":0},{"id":2424265,"s":1,"t":"Polyvagal State","k":"video","v":"brzd3dwr57qjsiw3s27u2upfnyji","d":152,"c":0},{"id":2422106,"s":1,"t":"Neuroception","k":"video","v":"kmz8y17mboz5omxzu2shzl5rsiig","d":183,"c":0},{"id":2426599,"s":1,"t":"Healthy & Unhealthy Neuroception","k":"video","v":"lg6dcuja1seg8ctlj0w6wtukj0o7","d":177,"c":0},{"id":2422107,"s":1,"t":"Story Follows State","k":"video","v":"49mqq2zon23i0nwblqigx1j1inhg","d":77,"c":0},{"id":2426656,"s":1,"t":"Story Follows State: Exercise","k":"activity","v":"qb43vvl7mg6tikr49ho15njcjzth","d":215,"c":0},{"id":2452693,"s":1,"t":"Autonomic Nervous System: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":0},{"id":2422110,"s":1,"t":"Autonomic Nervous System: Quiz","k":"quiz","q":[{"q":"The Polyvagal Ladder metaphor consists of","o":["fawn, freeze, and flop","safety, flight/fight, and shutdown","safety, flight, and fawn"],"a":1},{"q":"The Autonomic Nervous System...","o":["...functions unsconsciously.","...requires conscious control.","...is voluntary."],"a":0},{"q":"The nervous system is \"use dependent,\" meaning...","o":["...its strength depends on if you use it or not.","...being in Flight/Fight too much is bad for it.","...it adapts based on the needs for survival."],"a":2},{"q":"Neurocepting safety is dependent on...","o":["...safe people and/or safe environments.","...will power.","...making the right choices.","None of the above"],"a":0},{"q":"The Polyvagal Theory hypothesizes the sympathetic vs parasympathetic ANS duality is outdated.","o":["True","False"],"a":0},{"q":"All the Polyvagal ANS states increase the chances of surviving, except shutdown.","o":["True","False"],"a":1},{"q":"As we move down the Polyvagal Ladder, we lose access to functions from higher up.","o":["True","False"],"a":0},{"q":"The correct sequence of ladder climbing is:","o":["safety -> shutdown -> flight","fight -> flight -> shutdown","shutdown -> fight/flight -> safety"],"a":2},{"q":"Neuroceptive shifts are a result of...","o":["...voluntary decisions from the individual.","...unconscious detections of safety and danger.","...superhuman powers."],"a":1},{"q":"The thoughts in our conscious mind...","o":["...get there by choosing them.","...follow the state of the Autonomic Nervous System.","...are random.","All of the above."],"a":1}]},{"id":2422097,"s":1,"t":"Safety","k":"video","v":"ho2ug40gwgx28g1dpg4xma3krarz","d":484,"c":0},{"id":2426784,"s":1,"t":"Safety: What's Needed?","k":"video","v":"c0qkw4wj6ls41bqoqrzzo1ubcwp8","d":153,"c":0},{"id":2452694,"s":1,"t":"Safety: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":0},{"id":2422098,"s":1,"t":"Flight/Fight","k":"video","v":"i4fbga7su36s832mxu4k6bizavl4","d":446,"c":0},{"id":2452696,"s":1,"t":"Flight/Fight: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":0},{"id":2422099,"s":1,"t":"Shutdown","k":"video","v":"8sa29sflo4w4b1qcnxljuttsi3nl","d":493,"c":0},{"id":2452697,"s":1,"t":"Shutdown: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":0},{"id":2426575,"s":1,"t":"Down the Polyvagal Ladder Sequence","k":"video","v":"l4v1qz0w8rq89g9okbdd8k0p5yot","d":140},{"id":2426615,"s":1,"t":"Up the Polyvagal Ladder Sequence","k":"video","v":"9wsl9m1xyfslbhwublzb0celjghy","d":145},{"id":2422096,"s":1,"t":"Primary Autonomic States: Quiz","k":"quiz","q":[{"q":"A benefit of the safety state is...","o":["...improved cognitive functioning.","...improved ability to scan for danger.","...the ability to collapse and dissociate."],"a":0},{"q":"In the safety state, we can automatically...","o":["...feel more anxiety and get closer to others.","...have vocal prosody and safety touch.","...make gentle eye contact and tense muscles."],"a":1},{"q":"The perception of safety can override actual safety.","o":["True","False"],"a":0},{"q":"When in the flight/fight state, we have the impulse to...","o":["...create space from others.","...isolate with low stimulation.","...hug.","All of the above."],"a":0},{"q":"Being in a state of safety can be vulnerable and send someone down their ladder into a defensive state.","o":["True","False"],"a":0},{"q":"Survival benefits of the shutdown state include...","o":["...numbness and adrenaline.","...numbness and vocal prosody.","...numbness and dissociation.","None of the above."],"a":2},{"q":"We enter shutdown when we cannot...","o":["...be safe, run, or fight off a danger.","...be safe.","...run fast enough.","...fight very well."],"a":0},{"q":"Coming out of shutdown results in...","o":["...dissociation.","...a significant surge in fight energy.","...smiles and vocal prosody.","...the ability to think critically."],"a":1},{"q":"Humans need to come out of shutdown...","o":["...as fast as possible.","...by themselves.","...slowly.","...all at once in a large surge of sympathetic flight/fight."],"a":2},{"q":"In danger, the impulse to fight comes before the impulse for flight.","o":["True","False"],"a":1}]},{"id":2436874,"s":1,"t":"Mixed States","k":"video","v":"iejctdnrq18kcf8stxlbotnuvjkz","d":40},{"id":2422100,"s":1,"t":"Freeze","k":"video","v":"frhz52qkzsqxuyg087zafvnt4xqb","d":251,"c":0},{"id":2452698,"s":1,"t":"Freeze: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":0},{"id":2422101,"s":1,"t":"Play","k":"video","v":"19u2jvasqzrkmyphqjynqawozftx","d":266,"c":0},{"id":2452700,"s":1,"t":"Play: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":0},{"id":2422102,"s":1,"t":"Stillness","k":"video","v":"0xqc4ke3etuimcb6l4yhf5h5uzbe","d":165,"c":0},{"id":2452699,"s":1,"t":"Stillness: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":0},{"id":2422112,"s":1,"t":"Mixed Autonomic States: Quiz","k":"quiz","q":[{"q":"Freeze is the combination of safety and shutdown.","o":["True","False"],"a":1},{"q":"Stillness is the combination of safety and shutdown.","o":["True","False"],"a":0},{"q":"Play is the combination of flight/fight and safety.","o":["True","False"],"a":0},{"q":"Freeze and shutdown are different because...","o":["...freeze is more social.","...shutdown is easier to come out of.","...freeze is stiff and shutdown is limp.","...shutdown has high flight/fight activation."],"a":2},{"q":"It's not play if...","o":["...one of the people is not accessing their safety state.","...rules are being followed.","...turns are taken.","...face-to-face contact is happening."],"a":0},{"q":"An example of stillness is...","o":["...laying tensely in the dentist's chair.","...a panic attack.","...playing catch.","...meditation and self-reflection."],"a":3}]},{"id":2422108,"s":1,"t":"Trauma & the Polyvagal Theory","k":"video","v":"72z3tp5jiryjqueyiknbexz5f7xl","d":257,"c":0},{"id":2441647,"s":1,"t":"Trauma Path 1: Acute Life Threat","k":"video","v":"91ckajp2p3bb1no3xakmcv6sitq3","d":304,"c":0},{"id":2422109,"s":1,"t":"Trauma Path 2: Chronic Disruption of Connection","k":"video","v":"ke4khdja2y679weeqgh5ulewyr0v","d":304,"c":0},{"id":2441777,"s":1,"t":"Home Away from Home","k":"video","v":"spqc83s9554kh6bm8z0mkq7h8qdg","d":65,"c":0},{"id":2452701,"s":1,"t":"Trauma: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":0},{"id":2422111,"s":1,"t":"Vagal Brake & Distress Tolerance","k":"video","v":"bbv21dz2gr91v0j87stwa4xd1bsu","d":194,"c":1},{"id":2441870,"s":1,"t":"Strengthening the Vagal Brake","k":"video","v":"p9r9iyh1ragyzim6gxxo8fsmlp1m","d":134,"c":1},{"id":2422113,"s":1,"t":"Trauma & the Vagal Brake: Quiz","k":"quiz","q":[{"q":"Trauma is the response to the event, not the event itself.","o":["True","False"],"a":0},{"q":"Two paths to trauma are...","o":["...an acute life threat reaction and surviving war.","...an acute life threat reaction and chronic disruption of connectedness.","...a chronic disruption of connectedness and neglect.","None of the above"],"a":1},{"q":"Trauma is...","o":["...the thing that one survived.","...the love one didn't get.","...being stuck in a defensive state.","...flashbacks."],"a":2},{"q":"A \"home away from home\" is...","o":["...the flight/fight state.","...the shutdown state.","...the freeze mixed state.","...a defensive state one spends the most time in."],"a":3},{"q":"An example of ongoing, relentless stress is...","o":["...being robbed once by a stranger.","...surviving an assault.","...living in a crime-ridden neighborhood.","...a childhood fall."],"a":2}]},{"id":2422114,"s":1,"t":"Behavioral Adaptations & the Regulation Intersection","k":"video","v":"312b6y5g8e7hsa45cezcoz9n8rjj","d":268,"c":1},{"id":2452703,"s":1,"t":"Behavioral Adaptations: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":1},{"id":2422115,"s":1,"t":"Co-Regulation","k":"video","v":"t8ttluo3sbg5vcmtrgcepncx9rdr","d":282,"c":1},{"id":2422116,"s":1,"t":"Feedback Loop","k":"video","v":"ks9acpi35sk9sah54d9bfe9undpz","d":341,"c":1},{"id":2441869,"s":1,"t":"Co-Regulation: Exercise","k":"activity","v":"95dnv9dkpaz2k4savh78skv2c2ix","d":182,"c":1},{"id":2452702,"s":1,"t":"Co-Regulation: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":1},{"id":2422117,"s":1,"t":"Behavioral Adaptations & Co-Regulation: Quiz","k":"quiz","q":[{"q":"Which of these IS NOT another concept for the vagal brake?","o":["Distress tolerance","Window of tolerance","Resilience","A high level of neuroception"],"a":3},{"q":"The vagal brake is...","o":["...different from a bagel brake.","...the influence of the safety state on the heart.","...strengthened through thought replacement."],"a":1},{"q":"The vagal brake can be strengthened through...","o":["...having more fun in life.","...mindfully shifting between safety and defense."],"a":1},{"q":"Why don't behavioral adaptations actually help one get unstuck?","o":["The vagal brake isn't strengthening.","It's not the right kind of behavioral adaptation.","The adaptation doesn't match the person's state.","None of the above"],"a":0},{"q":"Co-regulation is...","o":["...receiving support from a loved one.","...going to therapy.","...eye contact.","...an unconscious biological communication process."],"a":3},{"q":"Co-regulation DOES NOT help one to climb their Polyvagal ladder through...","o":["...cues of safety.","...an unconscious biological communication process.","...positive behavior reinforcement.","...face-to-face interaction."],"a":2},{"q":"Humans evolved to connect through...","o":["...voice, touch, and face-to-face cues of safety.","...voice, touch, and prescribed breathing techniques.","...phone calls, touch, and face-to-face cues of safety."],"a":0},{"q":"Someone in shutdown communicating with someone in flight/fight is...","o":["...an example of neuroception.","...an example of a rupture.","...an example of co-regulation.","...an example of misattunement."],"a":3},{"q":"Ruptures can lead to thoughts like...","o":["\"Wow, I am incredible.\"","\"This has been a fantastic Polyvagal class.\"","\"Maybe I'm not very interesting.\"","\"This is such a great conversation!\""],"a":2},{"q":"The ability to self-regulate is built on...","o":["...a history of co-regulation.","...a history of healthy attachment.","...a strong enough vagal brake.","All of the above."],"a":3}]},{"id":2452706,"s":1,"t":"Create a New Narrative","k":"video","v":"w44zej88psgfk93rar3dvrypooo8","d":91,"c":1},{"id":2452707,"s":1,"t":"Create a New Narrative: Reflection","k":"reflection","c":1},{"id":2685555,"s":1,"t":"Leaving Breadcrumbs","k":"text","c":1},{"id":2685609,"s":1,"t":"Your First Breadcrumb","k":"text","c":1},{"id":2422118,"s":1,"t":"Congrats on Completing Stage 1!","k":"video","v":"9s9tbnte3gwm7lggp2vw57e6lvfg","